But the cookie started to turn on me because I took a big bite.

1194
00:50:43.910 --> 00:50:44.230
Okay.

1195
00:50:44.870 --> 00:50:45.350
Mistake.

1196
00:50:45.670 --> 00:50:45.910
Okay.

1197
00:50:46.050 --> 00:50:47.130
Take a small bite, guys.

1198
00:50:47.330 --> 00:50:47.630
Always.

1199
00:50:47.910 --> 00:50:48.230
Always.

