We don't know which take they used.

1217
00:51:23.510 --> 00:51:24.530
We don't know which take they used.

1218
00:51:24.530 --> 00:51:25.170
Was it early?

1219
00:51:25.250 --> 00:51:25.770
Was it late?

1220
00:51:25.890 --> 00:51:26.450
