You know, could you write down the name of that rehabilitation clinic you mentioned?

1262
00:53:29.390 --> 00:53:29.670
Wow.

1263
00:53:30.210 --> 00:53:30.350
Yeah.

1264
00:53:35.420 --> 00:53:36.060
Impressive.

1265
00:53:36.380 --> 00:53:36.860
That's great.

1266
