Instead of writing down a fake phone number, he wrote,

1269
00:53:54.180 --> 00:53:54.740
F*** you.

1270
00:53:55.920 --> 00:54:00.440
And so Steve in the scene glances down and it says,

1271
00:54:00.680 --> 00:54:01.120
F*** you.

