00:54:01.200 --> 00:54:05.140
And he started laughing and he couldn't even throw the pen because he was laughing too hard.

1273
00:54:05.220 --> 00:54:06.480
That is so funny.

1274
00:54:07.180 --> 00:54:14.360
Well, I'll have you know, Fakie Pen lived in the pen cup for weeks after we shot the scene.

1275
00:54:14.520 --> 00:54:19.920
And people were always coming over trying to grab a pen to use and they would get Fakie

1276
00:54:19.920 --> 00:54:20.600
rubber pen.

1277
00:54:21.140 --> 00:54:24.980
And I never got rid of it because it just was funny to me.

1278
00:54:25.120 --> 00:54:25.460
