1393
00:59:06.260 --> 00:59:07.020
I'm sure you didn't.

1394
00:59:07.100 --> 00:59:07.920
You're being hard on yourself.

1395
00:59:08.100 --> 00:59:09.880
He's like, no, no, I really think I screwed it up.

1396
00:59:09.960 --> 00:59:12.980
And he's kind of stuck on it and it wasn't very typical of him.

1397
00:59:12.980 --> 00:59:14.340
So I was like, tell me what happened.

1398
00:59:14.940 --> 00:59:22.420
And he said, well, I was supposed to be upset and sad because I wanted this Princess Unicorn

1399
00:59:22.420 --> 00:59:27.200
doll for my daughter and Daryl wanted the doll for his daughter and I needed to be really

1400
00:59:27.200 --> 00:59:27.700
