And so I thought of what Steve might do or what I thought Jenna might do, which is think

1402
00:59:34.540 --> 00:59:40.400
of something sad that happened in, in real life to them and something that like triggered

1403
00:59:41.160 --> 00:59:46.700
these sad feelings and sad emotions and kind of be in that place and use it for the scene.

1404
00:59:46.720 --> 00:59:48.580
And I said, well, it sounds smart.

1405
00:59:48.760 --> 00:59:49.940
Like how'd it go?

1406
00:59:50.020 --> 00:59:51.660
And he said, well, I didn't do that.

1407
00:59:52.500 --> 00:59:53.920
And I asked him why.

1408
00:59:54.020 --> 00:59:58.220
And he said, well, I thought about getting sad, but it didn't seem worth it.

1409
00:59:58.660 --> 01:00:04.520
