1430
01:01:04.540 --> 01:01:07.520
I'm going to be thinking about whatever precipitated it.

1431
01:01:07.780 --> 01:01:11.040
I love that Jen just wanted to give Paul s*** on our podcaSt.

1432
01:01:11.220 --> 01:01:11.660
I know.

1433
01:01:11.880 --> 01:01:14.740
She was just like, email hits my inbox.

1434
01:01:15.840 --> 01:01:17.120
Oh, so funny.

1435
01:01:17.380 --> 01:01:21.340
I agree, though, when I watched the scene, like I didn't think anything of it.

1436
01:01:21.480 --> 01:01:22.780
I was like, oh, that's perfect.

1437
01:01:23.240 --> 01:01:23.480
Yeah.

1438
01:01:24.140 --> 01:01:25.280
Oh, so funny.

1439
01:01:25.280 --> 01:01:29.960
And I guess she would, like, give him shiitake about that for years to come.

