1454
01:02:26.220 --> 01:02:28.460
Like my face started to flush.

1455
01:02:28.680 --> 01:02:28.880
Yeah.

1456
01:02:29.040 --> 01:02:30.060
You can see it.

1457
01:02:30.060 --> 01:02:32.360
Everyone is looking at you.

1458
01:02:32.840 --> 01:02:33.360
Everyone.

1459
